  "notes": "All 25 were independently re-solved from stem+choices before key comparison. They resolve uniquely to カ変・サ変・ナ変・ラ変. Coverage includes 来, す, おはす, 死ぬ, 往ぬ, あり, をり, 侍り and spans 未然・連用・終止・連体・已然・命令 forms. A draft stem 'かくす' was rejected before QA because it could visually collide with 隠す; it was replaced by unambiguous '学問をす'. External grammar checks reconfirmed カ変 こ/き/く/くる/くれ/こ(よ), サ変 せ/し/す/する/すれ/せよ, ナ変 な/に/ぬ/ぬる/ぬれ/ね, and ラ変 ら/り/り/る/れ/れ. No invented historical forms. Full-bank semantic near-duplicate clearance remains pending.",
